      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Note: access to the Spring <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a> is only possible when the\n<a href=\"#setTriggerEventType(java.lang.Class)\"><code>triggerEventType</code></a> is set to\n<a href=\"event/ApplicationEnvironmentPreparedEvent.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.context.event\"><code>ApplicationEnvironmentPreparedEvent</code></a>, <a href=\"event/ApplicationReadyEvent.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.context.event\"><code>ApplicationReadyEvent</code></a>, or\n<a href=\"event/ApplicationPreparedEvent.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.context.event\"><code>ApplicationPreparedEvent</code></a>.",
      "translation": "注意：只有在将 <a href=\"#setTriggerEventType(java.lang.Class)\"><code>triggerEventType</code></a> 设置为 <a href=\"event/ApplicationEnvironmentPreparedEvent.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.context.event\"><code>ApplicationEnvironmentPreparedEvent</code></a>、<a href=\"event/ApplicationReadyEvent.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.context.event\"><code>ApplicationReadyEvent</code></a> 或 <a href=\"event/ApplicationPreparedEvent.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.context.event\"><code>ApplicationPreparedEvent</code></a> 时，才能访问 Spring <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "If PID file can not be created no exception is reported. This behavior can be changed\nby assigning <code>true</code> to System property or environment variable named\n<code>PID_FAIL_ON_WRITE_ERROR</code> (or \"pid_fail_on_write_error\") or to\n<code>spring.pid.fail-on-write-error</code> property in the Spring <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a>.",
      "translation": "如果无法创建 PID 文件，则不会报告异常。可以通过将名为<code>PID_FAIL_ON_WRITE_ERROR</code>（或\"pid_fail_on_write_error\"）的系统属性或环境变量设置为<code>true</code>，或将 Spring <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a>中的<code>spring.pid.fail-on-write-error</code>属性设置为<code>true</code>来更改此行为。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Sets the type of application event that will trigger writing of the PID file.\nDefaults to <a href=\"event/ApplicationPreparedEvent.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.context.event\"><code>ApplicationPreparedEvent</code></a>. NOTE: If you use the\n<a href=\"event/ApplicationStartingEvent.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.context.event\"><code>ApplicationStartingEvent</code></a> to trigger\nthe write, you will not be able to specify the PID filename in the Spring\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a>.",
      "translation": "设置触发 PID 文件写入的应用程序事件类型。默认为 <a href=\"event/ApplicationPreparedEvent.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.context.event\"><code>ApplicationPreparedEvent</code></a>。注意：如果您使用 <a href=\"event/ApplicationStartingEvent.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.context.event\"><code>ApplicationStartingEvent</code></a> 来触发写入，则无法在 Spring <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a> 中指定 PID 文件名。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
